Package: job
Version: @version@-1
Architecture: @arch@
Maintainer: TR-RBM <47713618+TR-RBM@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/TR-RBM/job
Description: execution and scheduling service for Linux
 job runs commands as Jobs under a service that keeps them independent of
 the terminal they came from and records what they printed and how they
 ended. Jobs are organized into queues and groups, with reserved and limited
 resources, namespaces, network boundaries and remote hosts over SSH.
